{"id":"620598","name":"手工馒头","author":"英英菜谱","authorId":"6968441","desc":"","cover":"images/620598/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"面粉","amount":"550克"}],"sub":[{"name":"酵母","amount":"4克"},{"name":"白糖","amount":"3克"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"备面粉、酵母、白糖。","img":"images/620598/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"用温水化开酵母、白糖倒入面粉中，和成软硬适中的面团，饧发至两倍大。","img":"images/620598/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"面团放在案板上揉匀，分成剂子。","img":"images/620598/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"揉成馒头形。","img":"images/620598/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"加盖二次饧发二十五分钟。","img":"images/620598/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"凉水入锅，放入馒头。","img":"images/620598/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"水开后，中火蒸二十五分钟。","img":"images/620598/step_7.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：蒸锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}